{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24967","headline":"寄羽士 · 牟融","name":"寄羽士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别来有路隔仙凡，几度临风欲去难。\n乐道无时忘鹤伴，谈玄何日到星坛。\n山中胜景常留客，林下清风好炼丹。\n使我浮生尘鞅脱，相从应得一盘桓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}